0,Semnani language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semnani_language,"Semnani (سمنانی زفون, Semani zefön) is the main language of the Semnan province of Iran and has several branches. The language belongs to the Northwestern branch of the Western Iranian languages.",Semnani,Indo-European
1,Semnani languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semnani_languages,"The Semnani languages or Komisenian languages are a group of Northwestern Iranian languages, [2] spoken in Semnan province of Iran that share many linguistic features and structures with most other Iranian languages, and are part of the Caspian languages.",Semnani,Indo-European
2,"The Sound of Indo-European Music (Compilation) - YouTubeSemnani languages - WikipediaSemnani languages — GrokipediaIndo Eu - YouTube MusicIndoeuropean Rhythm - Thomas Fitz-Hugh - Google BooksStream semnani music | Listen to songs, albums, playlists for ...",https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WgHSW774Q-4,"Sep 8, 2019 · In this video, I compiled music from all the major Indo-European languages. I hope you enjoy these great songs! The Semnani languages or Komisenian languages are a group of Northwestern Iranian languages, [2] spoken in Semnan province of Iran that share many linguistic features and structures with most other Iranian languages, and are part of the Caspian languages. The Semnani languages, also known as the Komisenian or Komeši languages, are a closely related group of Northwestern Iranian languages within the Indo-Iranian branch of the Indo-European family, forming a linguistic Sprachbund spoken primarily in and around the Semnan province of northern Iran. Tennessee Stud (feat. Doc Watson) Jul 18, 2023 · This groundbreaking study explores the connections between Indo-European languages and the rhythms of human speech and music. Play semnani and discover followers on SoundCloud | Stream tracks, albums, playlists on desktop and mobile.",Semnani,Indo-European
